  "releaseNotes": "Application Use:\n* Connect to Brainboxes Ltd digital Input and Output hardware - For the full product range view http://www.brainboxes.com/remote-io\n\nChange Log:\n1.0.16 https://github.com/Industry4/MultiPlug.Ext.Brainboxes/issues/1\n1.0.15 Not Stable. Pre 1.0.16\n1.0.14 Applied new Base classes\n1.0.13 Applied new Base classes\n1.0.12 Enhancement: Complete refresh of the User Interface\n1.0.10 Enhancement: Rising Edge and Falling Edge has now been merged into one event.\n1.0.9 Enhancement: Implemented new MultiPlug.Base 1.0.25 contracts.\n1.0.8 Bug: Init fail.\nEnhancement: I/O will toggle is no High or Low Value found in the event pairs.\n1.0.7 Enhancement: User Interface changes, 1.0.6 feature enhanced so for-each subscription values to seek from event pairs for Highs and Lows can be set. Toggling introduced in 1.0.6 has been removed for now.\n1.0.6 Enhancement: Subscription Output seeks pair 'type' of 'value' with value of 0 or 1, and if not found toggles the output (on/off)\nBug: Device settings were being lost on startup.\n\nBrainboxes is a trademark of Brainboxes Ltd",
